<title>USA: Clothestime, creditors reach agreement.</title>
<headline>Clothestime, creditors reach agreement.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Clothestime Inc said it reached an agreement with the official committee of unsecured creditors on a plan of reorganization that will enable it to emerge from Chapter 11 bankruptcy proceedings.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to file the reorganization plan by the end of the month. It said details of the plan will be made public at that time.</p>
</text>
